  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The Modern Cottage is a stylish, family-friendly retreat with 3 king bedrooms, a bunk room, bikes, a golf cart, and everything you need for a relaxing 30A getaway. Just minutes from the beach, Rosemary, and 30Avenue—with a pool steps away and thoughtful touches for kids and families.<br><br>The cottage features three spacious king bedrooms, each with premium mattresses, blackout shades, and smart TVs. A separate bunk room sleeps four in twin-over-twin bunks—perfect for kids or cousins. Every detail has been considered for your convenience: from a fully stocked kitchen to a washer and dryer, sound machines, and family essentials like a Pack-n-Play, high chair, and kids’ dishes.<br><br>The open-concept living room and kitchen create the perfect place to gather. You’ll find a large dining table, counter seating, smart TV, games, books, and comfortable seating for relaxing after a day at the beach.<br><br>Step outside to enjoy a quiet front porch, an outdoor shower, a Weber grill, and a private driveway and garage. You’ll also have access to a beautiful neighborhood pool just steps away.<br><br>To help you explore, we include four adult beach cruiser bikes and a street-legal LSV (Low Speed Vehicle)—great for rides to Rosemary Beach, 30Avenue, or just hauling beach gear. (Drivers must be 21+ with license + insurance; waiver required.)<br><br>Included in your stay:<br>• 4 adult cruiser bikes<br>• Brand-new street-legal LSV<br>• 3 king bedrooms + 1 bunk room<br>• Smart TVs in every room (Roku Guest Mode)<br>• Fast Wi-Fi + workspace options<br>• Crib, high chair, games, books, and more<br>• Beach chairs, beach towels, umbrella, and toys<br>• Fully stocked kitchen with coffee makers + tools<br>• Washer, dryer, and starter supplies<br><br>EV Charger: The garage includes a 40A Level 2 EV charger (J1772) compatible with most electric vehicles, including Tesla (with adapter).<br><br>Note on the Neighborhood:<br>The Modern Cottage is located in Wildwood, a new and quiet community near 30A. While some construction may still be happening nearby, we’ve worked to ensure minimal impact on your stay.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
