      {
        "author": "Lynsey W.",
        "date": "2026-01-16T18:51:29Z",
        "id": "696a976dc48ea36f8a632f67",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We had a great visit! The home is clean, comfortable and well equipped (and so nice when everything is brand new!). We loved having the LSV/golf cart available for quick trips to 30 Avenue. The location worked out great—a 2 minute drive to the beach yet tucked into a quiet, new neighborhood. The hosts were welcoming and responsive. We loved our time at the Modern Cottage and hope to return again soon!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Jeff J.",
        "date": "2025-12-27T18:36:29Z",
        "id": "6950357732fdce5597db5c8d",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our family wanted a great getaway on 30A. We found the modern cottage and loved all the space the house had! So many king beds, a room of bunk beds that our kids loved, and every amenity we needed! The beds were extremely comfortable and the house was perfect for relaxing and being together! Loved the golf cart and that every single thing in the home is brand new! Host was extremely responsive and made it super easy for us. Highly recommend. We will be returning to the modern cottage!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Dana B.",
        "date": "2025-12-30T19:02:29Z",
        "id": "6954303df26c731d1e2d0d9d",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Most exceptional Vrbo experience to date! Initial communications with the Hosts- Bryson and Meyer, were quick and thorough. Check in and out was super clear and easy. The house had it all! Felt more like a 5star beach stay with high quality decor, features and amenities. Location is prime. 3 min away from Rosemary and beyond. But tucked in beautiful Inlet Beach with less people and traffic. Dream experience!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Lee V.",
        "date": "2025-11-27T16:26:15Z",
        "id": "69288a7328494d56e4453f89",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Excellent place to rest, the beds are extremely comfortable and high quality! Fantastic linens and towels in every room. The Cottage was well stocked and very airy. The shops near by were fun and fitting for all ages.Absolute magnificent stay- I would highly recommend!!!",
